# Sum

An estimate computed by summing inputs.

◇

subclass_of_key: method

attributes:
    - key: sum_count
      name: Sum Count
      details: Number of inputs into this sum.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: sum_mean
      name: Sum Mean
      details: Middle of the summed bell curve.
      rules: "[unconstrained .. unconstrained] at 0.01 unit"
      type_spec: Real
    - key: sum_variance
      name: Sum Variance
      details: Shape of the summed bell curve.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 0.01 unit"
      type_spec: Real
